      "created_at": "2021-09-16T06:40:53.460Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p>\n<p>Digging in my basement I found a box containing a portion of my old  SoTM collection. It contains a couple of expansions (Shattered Timelines and Oblivaeon)…and more importantly a bunch of the Kickstarter promo cards (Ra, Horus of Two Horizons Promo Card and similar ones). I would have to do a full check, but I think it has every single promo ever printed.</p>\n<p>At the time they were very rare and sought for… but since they did a hero variant collection. There is no gameplay difference, but art is distinct.</p>\n<p>Is there a market for those promos? How much do you think they would go for?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-09-16T06:40:53.460Z",
